 is a column vector."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400324 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087702 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4c6056ee-15f3-5b5c-8a14-173ea1da1381" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Singular Matrices"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4ba324b7-0f59-5f58-97d8-72603006234e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472568} {:answer/id #uuid "35d1bf70-dd44-5f00-ace4-811a4e3e1bbb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472569}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "35d1bf70-dd44-5f00-ace4-811a4e3e1bbb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472569} :answer-field/id #uuid "70d07d03-c34c-5845-8935-896ff2fde738" :answer-field/key "$A=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 9\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473679} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6761343e-3cb3-55f7-a59d-31304c33661b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472570} {:answer/id #uuid "b1649aac-77b0-5dac-9373-2f007c41a012" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472571}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6761343e-3cb3-55f7-a59d-31304c33661b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472570} :answer-field/id #uuid "6588ae30-e559-5601-8ef8-17cc3ef6f0a1" :answer-field/key "$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 15 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473680} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5499f975-6325-5729-a9ba-045a3cca2d15" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472572} {:answer/id #uuid "3bc00b66-d40e-52ef-8970-33efae0b0fac" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472573}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5499f975-6325-5729-a9ba-045a3cca2d15" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472572} :answer-field/id #uuid "7cced4e2-6cfd-5a39-854d-313251047edc" :answer-field/key "$C=\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473681}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "dd3729c7-43c0-5883-808f-5b63c7f7af84" :question/math-academy-id "q-127826" :question/problem "Which of the matrices below does **not** have an inverse?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "- The matrix $A$ is a $3\\times 1$ matrix. So, it is not invertible.\n\n- For the matrix $B$, we have\n\n$$\ndet(B)=-3\\cdot 5-1\\cdot 15=-30.\n$$\n\nBecause $det(B)\\ne 0,$ we conclude that $B$ is invertible.\n\n- For the matrix $C$, we have\n\n$$\ndet(C)=7\\cdot 2-3\\cdot 4=2.\n$$\n\nBecause $det(C)\\ne 0,$ we conclude that $C$ is invertible.\n\nTherefore, only $A$ does not have an inverse."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400331 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115236 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "64b2036f-da0f-59de-8a39-6b33e6cbdd04" :knowledge-point/title "Completing a True Statement"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ef111d9f-980c-5b03-9930-80f18435b245" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472580} {:answer/id #uuid "a6862f2d-2762-5b0e-8f3a-1253e37655d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472581}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a6862f2d-2762-5b0e-8f3a-1253e37655d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472581} :answer-field/id #uuid "5faeea23-e6b1-5b91-87f6-7b0a4fef3dcc" :answer-field/key "$det(A)\\ne 0$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473685} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6aefd83a-6b4c-56c7-b747-345c373d9b14" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472582} {:answer/id #uuid "24c81c04-8905-5c94-ac90-a70db567f3a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472583}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "24c81c04-8905-5c94-ac90-a70db567f3a8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472583} :answer-field/id #uuid "e2bd5816-6d9d-5da2-8f3f-64ef8acdb893" :answer-field/key "$Ax=b$ has exactly one solution" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473686} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e6738bb8-1870-5396-9a90-bba160d497e7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472584} {:answer/id #uuid "e7fc74ba-8f62-5436-9d2e-3c858d0578e2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472585}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e6738bb8-1870-5396-9a90-bba160d497e7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186472584} :answer-field/id #uuid "7584f499-906d-554c-842b-3985b246d9ba" :answer-field/key "$Ax=0$ has infinitely many solutions" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473687}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a2d9404d-2d42-56c6-b91b-5351ccec57cf" :question/math-academy-id "q-128139" :question/problem "Which of the following completes the statement so that it is true:\n\n*If a $2\\times 2$-matrix $A$ is invertible, then $\\underline{\\phantom{xxxxxx}}$ . *\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Since $A$ is invertible, $\\operatorname{det}(A)\\ne 0.$ Also, for each vector $b,$ the equation $Ax=b$ has the unique solution $x=A^{-1}b.$ In particular, $Ax=0$ has only the zero solution. Thus statements $det(A)\\ne 0$ and “$Ax=b$ has exactly one solution” are true and statement “$Ax=0$ has infinitely many solutions” is false. The correct answer is $det(A)\\ne 0$; “$Ax=b$ has exactly one solution” only."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400338 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186105908 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "26c84e5b-97a7-5116-a90c-e4f011e87cf0" :knowledge-point/title "Determining Whether Three Vectors are Coplanar"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ae4f142e-64ca-5cf1-bba5-1bb7e5f38aea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439465} {:answer/id #uuid "de3a62f1-ef79-57d9-abd6-9050be028873" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439466}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ae4f142e-64ca-5cf1-bba5-1bb7e5f38aea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439465} :answer-field/id #uuid "f3764